find nb: parameters one f32 can carry together (an interface change, proposed for the code that stores them)
    x, idx and valid as one f32: x is used only where valid holds and idx only where it does not, x is finite and idx in [0, 2^22), so s is x or a quiet NaN carrying idx, and the NaN never reaches arithmetic;
